      "author": "maggiedelano",
      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Expand on the taxonomy of unwanted tracking. In particular, include discussion of tag placement and anticipation of unwanted location tracking.",
