      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Update the document to include a requirement that \"Platforms should assist user in locating trackers.\"\n\nDiscuss ways in which platforms might assist users, such as notifications (see [this issue](https://github.com/ietf-wg-dult/threat-model/issues/29)), user interface, disablement, etc. Confirm what is in the [charter](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/charter-ietf-dult/) when considering what should be required vs. suggested to platforms.",
